  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The different animations (on index) don't flow correctly from one to the other, and the new animations completely Ruin 3 of the sign languages i help assist in teaching,\n\nit might be a nice change for people looking for something new, but this can easily ruin accessibility for mute and deaf people,\n\n as a simple recommendation i personally think the best option is a toggle in IK systems similar to how its set in the full-body menu, \"legacy hand IK\" or something similarly named in the controls or IK menu\n\nalso having to press triggers fully down sometimes to press menu buttons is pretty inconvenient and unhealthy for the index controller\n\nsimilarly having the grip permanently set to \"light grip mode\" despite looking into the new binding settings and finding no solutions is a bit of a problem for maps that require you to hold items for long periods of time as this causes you to drop and pick up the item constantly, as well as inconvenience with pens",
